    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Acute bronchitis:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " patients with wheezing may benefit from an inhaled beta2-agonist (eg, albuterol) for a few days; broader use is not recommended (tremor, nervousness and shaking are common)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " hypersensitivity to any ingredient. Caution in cardiovascular disease (coronary insufficiency, arrhythmias, HTN); ECG changes (T-wave flattening, QTc prolongation, ST depression) are reported."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Beta-blockers block the effect and can cause severe bronchospasm in asthma (cardioselective only, with caution, if no alternative). Loop/thiazide diuretics: hypokalemia and ECG changes can worsen. Digoxin levels may fall; consider monitoring. MAOIs/TCAs (or within 2 weeks of stopping): extreme caution, vascular effects potentiated."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Prime (4 sprays away from the face, shaking before each) before first use, after > 2 weeks unused, or if dropped. Needing more doses than usual may mean worsening asthma: seek reevaluation."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
